#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/video.rst:304
msgid ""
"On Diffusers, SGLang, and vLLM, the video generation page shows a "
"**Lightning** switch once the adapter is loaded. Pass "
"``use_lightning=False`` in a Python client generation call, or include "
